  Presented to the Faculties of the University of Pennsylvania\par
  in\par Partial Fulfillment of the Requirements for the\par
  Degree of Doctor of Philosophy\par\@degreeyear\par
  \vspace{12pt}\endgroup\begingroup\setstretch{1}\raggedright
  Supervisor of Dissertation\par\@advisor\par\penn@supervisortitle\par
  \ifdefempty{\penncosupervisor}{}{\vspace{12pt}Co-Supervisor of Dissertation\par\penncosupervisor\par\penncosupervisortitle\par}
